function BusinessDetailV6({id,navigate,onBack,onFollowChanged}:any){const cached=mobileCacheV5.businessDetail[id];const [d,setD]=useState<any>(cached);const [loading,setLoading]=useState(!cached);const [err,setErr]=useState('');const [refreshing,setRefreshing]=useState(false);const load=async(refresh=false)=>{if(refresh)setRefreshing(true);else if(!d)setLoading(true);setErr('');try{const x=await apiGet('business.detail',{id,_t:Date.now()});mobileCacheV5.businessDetail[id]=x;setD(x)}catch(e:any){setErr(e.message)}finally{setLoading(false);setRefreshing(false)}};useEffect(()=>{load(false);const sub=AppState.addEventListener('change',(st:string)=>{if(st==='active')load(true)});return()=>sub.remove()},[id]);if(loading&&!d)return <Loader/>;if(err&&!d)return <ErrorState message={err} onRetry={()=>load(false)}/>;const b=d.business;const contact=()=>navigate('chatThread',{businessId:b.id});return <View style={{flex:1}}><View style={{height:64,justifyContent:'center',paddingHorizontal:14}}><Pressable onPress={onBack} style={{position:'absolute',right:14,width:44,height:44,borderRadius:22,backgroundColor:'#fff',borderWidth:1,borderColor:palette.border,alignItems:'center',justifyContent:'center'}}><AppIcon name="chevron-right" size={27} color={palette.primary}/></Pressable></View><ScrollView refreshControl={<RefreshControl refreshing={refreshing} onRefresh={()=>load(true)} colors={[palette.primary]}/>} contentContainerStyle={{paddingHorizontal:14,paddingBottom:30}}><View style={{minHeight:82,paddingRight:66,justifyContent:'center',position:'relative',marginBottom:10}}><View style={{position:'absolute',right:0,width:52,height:52,borderRadius:17,backgroundColor:palette.primarySoft,alignItems:'center',justifyContent:'center',overflow:'hidden'}}>{b.cover?.url?<Image source={{uri:b.cover.url}} style={{width:'100%',height:'100%'}} resizeMode="cover"/>:<AppIcon name="storefront-outline" size={26} color={palette.primary}/>}</View><Txt style={{fontSize:19,fontWeight:'900',textAlign:'right',width:'100%'}}>{b.name}</Txt><Txt style={{fontSize:12.5,color:palette.text2,textAlign:'right',width:'100%',marginTop:2}}>{[b.province,b.city].filter(Boolean).join('، ')}</Txt></View>{b.description?<View style={{backgroundColor:'#fff',borderWidth:1,borderColor:palette.border,borderRadius:18,padding:13,marginBottom:9}}><Txt style={{fontSize:13,lineHeight:22,textAlign:'right',width:'100%'}}>{b.description}</Txt></View>:null}{d.is_owner?<><SecondaryButton title="ویرایش کسب‌وکار" icon="pencil-outline" onPress={()=>navigate('editBusiness',{id:b.id})}/><SecondaryButton title={`${d.followers||0} دنبال‌کننده • مشاهده فهرست`} icon="account-group-outline" onPress={()=>navigate('followers',{id:b.id})}/></>:null}{!d.is_owner?<PrimaryButton title="گفتگوی رایگان در اپلیکیشن" icon="message-text-outline" onPress={contact}/>:null}<BusinessPublicInfo data={d}/>{err?<Txt accessibilityRole="alert" style={{color:palette.danger,marginVertical:8}}>{err}</Txt>:null}{!d.is_owner?<SecondaryButton title={d.is_following?'دنبال می‌کنید':'دنبال کردن'} icon={d.is_following?'heart':'heart-outline'} onPress={async()=>{try{await apiPost('follow.toggle',{business_id:b.id});mobileCacheV5.home=null;await load(false);await onFollowChanged?.()}catch(e:any){setErr(e.message)}}}/>:null}<View style={{minHeight:38,justifyContent:'center',alignItems:'flex-end',marginTop:8,marginBottom:6}}><Txt style={{fontSize:16,fontWeight:'900',textAlign:'right',width:'100%'}}>محصولات</Txt></View>{(d.products||[]).map((p:any)=><ProductCardV7 key={p.id} p={p} onPress={()=>navigate('productDetail',{id:p.id,name:p.name})}/>)}{!(d.products||[]).length?<EmptyState title="محصولی ثبت نشده"/>:null}</ScrollView></View>}

function ImageViewerV6({uri,onClose}:any){return <Modal visible={!!uri} animationType="fade" transparent={false} onRequestClose={onClose}><View style={{flex:1,backgroundColor:'#070A09'}}><StatusBar barStyle="light-content" backgroundColor="#070A09"/><Pressable onPress={onClose} style={{position:'absolute',right:16,top:18,zIndex:3,width:46,height:46,borderRadius:23,backgroundColor:'rgba(255,255,255,.14)',alignItems:'center',justifyContent:'center'}}><AppIcon name="close" size={26} color="#fff"/></Pressable>{uri?<Image source={{uri}} style={{flex:1,width:'100%',height:'100%'}} resizeMode="contain"/>:null}</View></Modal>}

function ProductDetailV6({id,navigate,onBack}:any){const {width}=useWindowDimensions();const cached=mobileCacheV5.productDetail[id];const [d,setD]=useState<any>(cached);const [loading,setLoading]=useState(!cached);const [err,setErr]=useState('');const [uploading,setUploading]=useState(false);const [viewer,setViewer]=useState('');const load=async()=>{if(!d)setLoading(true);setErr('');try{const x=await apiGet('product.detail',{id,_t:Date.now()});mobileCacheV5.productDetail[id]=x;setD(x)}catch(e:any){setErr(e.message)}finally{setLoading(false)}};useEffect(()=>{load();const sub=AppState.addEventListener('change',(st:string)=>{if(st==='active')load()});return()=>sub.remove()},[id]);if(loading&&!d)return <Loader/>;if(err&&!d)return <ErrorState message={err} onRetry={load}/>;const p=d.product;const media=d.media||[];const contact=()=>navigate('chatThread',{businessId:p.business_id});const pick=async()=>{const r=await launchImageLibrary({mediaType:'mixed',selectionLimit:1});if(r.didCancel||!r.assets?.[0])return;setUploading(true);try{await uploadMedia(id,r.assets[0]);await load()}catch(e:any){setErr(e.message)}finally{setUploading(false)}};return <View style={{flex:1}}><Header title={p.name||'محصول'} back onBack={onBack}/><ScrollView contentContainerStyle={{padding:14,paddingBottom:30}}>{err?<Txt style={{color:palette.danger,textAlign:'right',width:'100%',marginBottom:7}}>{err}</Txt>:null}{media.length?<ScrollView horizontal pagingEnabled showsHorizontalScrollIndicator={false} style={{marginHorizontal:-14,marginBottom:12}}>{media.map((m:any)=>m.type==='video'?<View key={m.id} style={{width,paddingHorizontal:14}}><Video source={{uri:m.url}} style={{height:290,borderRadius:21,backgroundColor:'#101614'}} controls paused resizeMode="contain"/></View>:<Pressable key={m.id} onPress={()=>setViewer(m.url)} style={{width,paddingHorizontal:14}}><Image source={{uri:m.url}} style={{height:290,borderRadius:21,backgroundColor:palette.border}} resizeMode="cover"/><View style={{position:'absolute',left:26,bottom:12,width:36,height:36,borderRadius:12,backgroundColor:'rgba(0,0,0,.46)',alignItems:'center',justifyContent:'center'}}><AppIcon name="fullscreen" size={20} color="#fff"/></View></Pressable>)}</ScrollView>:<View style={{height:210,borderRadius:21,backgroundColor:palette.surface2,alignItems:'center',justifyContent:'center',marginBottom:11}}><AppIcon name="image-outline" size={42} color={palette.text2}/></View>}<Txt style={{fontSize:19,fontWeight:'900',textAlign:'right',width:'100%'}}>{p.name}</Txt><Pressable onPress={()=>navigate('businessDetail',{id:p.business_id})}><Txt style={{fontSize:12.5,color:palette.text2,textAlign:'right',width:'100%',marginTop:2}}>{p.business_name||''}</Txt></Pressable><Txt style={{fontSize:19,color:palette.primary,fontWeight:'900',textAlign:'right',width:'100%',marginVertical:8}}>{Number(p.price||0)>0?`${money(p.price)} تومان`:'قیمت توافقی'}</Txt>{p.description?<View style={{backgroundColor:'#fff',borderWidth:1,borderColor:palette.border,borderRadius:18,padding:13,marginBottom:9}}><Txt style={{fontSize:13,lineHeight:22,textAlign:'right',width:'100%'}}>{p.description}</Txt></View>:null}{!d.is_owner?<><PrimaryButton title="گفتگوی رایگان در اپلیکیشن" icon="message-text-outline" onPress={contact}/></>:null}{d.is_owner?<View style={{backgroundColor:'#fff',borderWidth:1,borderColor:palette.border,borderRadius:18,padding:13,marginTop:9}}><Txt style={{fontSize:15.5,fontWeight:'900',marginBottom:4,textAlign:'right',width:'100%'}}>مدیریت رسانه</Txt><Txt style={{fontSize:12,color:palette.text2,marginBottom:8,textAlign:'right',width:'100%'}}>فضا: {d.quota?.storage_used_mb||0} از {d.quota?.storage_limit_mb||0} مگابایت</Txt><PrimaryButton title={uploading?'در حال بارگذاری…':'افزودن عکس یا ویدئو'} icon="image-plus" onPress={pick} disabled={uploading}/></View>:null}</ScrollView><ImageViewerV6 uri={viewer} onClose={()=>setViewer('')}/></View>}


function StoreCardV7({b,onPress}:any){const [bad,setBad]=useState(false);useEffect(()=>setBad(false),[b.cover?.url]);return <Pressable onPress={onPress} style={({pressed})=>[{backgroundColor:'#fff',borderWidth:1,borderColor:palette.border,borderRadius:18,minHeight:94,marginBottom:9,paddingVertical:12,paddingRight:70,paddingLeft:38,justifyContent:'center',position:'relative',opacity:pressed ? .9 : 1}]}><View style={{position:'absolute',right:12,top:18,width:48,height:48,borderRadius:15,backgroundColor:palette.primarySoft,alignItems:'center',justifyContent:'center',overflow:'hidden'}}>{b.cover?.url&&!bad?<Image source={{uri:b.cover.url}} onError={()=>setBad(true)} style={{width:'100%',height:'100%'}} resizeMode="cover"/>:<AppIcon name="storefront-outline" size={23} color={palette.primary}/>}</View><View style={{width:'100%',alignItems:'flex-end'}}><Txt numberOfLines={1} style={{fontSize:15,fontWeight:'900',textAlign:'right',width:'100%'}}>{b.name}</Txt><Txt style={{fontSize:12,color:palette.text2,textAlign:'right',width:'100%',marginTop:2}}>{[b.province,b.city].filter(Boolean).join('، ')||'موقعیت ثبت نشده'}</Txt>{b.description?<Txt numberOfLines={2} style={{fontSize:12,color:palette.text2,textAlign:'right',width:'100%',marginTop:3}}>{b.description}</Txt>:null}</View><View style={{position:'absolute',left:11,top:34}}><AppIcon name="chevron-left" size={24} color={palette.text2}/></View></Pressable>}
